    doc="Voice-controlled music: notes, chords, scales, ten public-domain songs, a melody the user composes, tempo, volume, instruments (Tone.js synth presets), transposition, and music theory questions answered with the vendored tonal library (vendor/tonal.mjs). The host plays the sound (Tone.js) and draws sheet music (abcjs) and a keyboard. State lives in ctx.state. Hand-built platform fixture, not produced by the C1 workflow."
